@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@accessToken = replace-with-local-access-token
@mediaId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Read photo locations using the existing paged media API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media?mediaKind=image&offset=0&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Set a photo location (owner or admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/media/{{mediaId}}/location
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 10.7769,
  "longitude": 106.7009
}

### Remove a photo location without modifying the original file
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/media/{{mediaId}}/location
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": null,
  "longitude": null
}

### Invalid coordinates return a validation problem
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/media/{{mediaId}}/location
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 91,
  "longitude": 0
}

### Scan one batch; use nextOffset from the response while hasMore is true
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media/locations/scan?offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
